# Claude
# The CLAUDE.md convention files and PLAN.md are tracked deliberately — they are
# shared team context. The agent definitions and MCP server wiring are not: they
# encode one person's local tooling setup, including which servers are installed.
.claude/
.mcp.json
.claudeignore
CLAUDE.local.md

